{"url": "https://bigfuture.collegeboard.org/help-center/whos-eligible-scholarships-bigfuture", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\">\n<head>\n  \n  <script src=\"//kiwi.collegeboard.org/embed.js\" async></script>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Students in the classes of 2027, 2028, and 2029 are eligible for BigFuture Scholarships. They must have a College Board account and attend public or private high school or be enrolled in a home school in the United States, Puerto Rico, or any other U.S. territory. U.S. citizens and residents attending Department of War Education Activity (DoWEA) schools are also eligible. When students complete one or more qualifying steps on their BigFuture dashboard, they\u2019ll be automatically entered into monthly drawings for $500 or $40,000 until their senior year. Students can opt out of scholarship drawings here.\" />\n<meta name=\"internal-search-title\" content=\"Who\u2019s eligible for scholarships from BigFuture? \u2013 BigFuture\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://bigfuture.collegeboard.org/help-center/whos-eligible-scholarships-bigfuture\" />\n<meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://secure-media.collegeboard.org/social-media/CB_og-image_v1.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://secure-media.collegeboard.org/social-media/CB_og-image_v1.png\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=2\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@graph\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n            \"mainEntity\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Who\u2019s eligible for scholarships from BigFuture?\",\n                \"answerCount\": \"1\",\n                \"dateCreated\": \"2026-11-16\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                    \"text\": [\n                        \"Students in the classes of 2027\",\n                        \"2028\",\n                        \"and 2029 are eligible for BigFuture Scholarships. They must have a College Board account and attend public or private high school or be enrolled in a home school in the United States\",\n                        \"Puerto Rico\",\n                        \"or any other U.S. territory. U.S. citizens and residents attending Department of War Education Activity (DoWEA) schools are also eligible. When students complete one or more qualifying steps on their BigFuture dashboard\",\n                        \"they\u2019ll be automatically entered into monthly drawings for $500 or $40\",\n                        \"000 until their senior year. Students can opt out of scholarship drawings here.\"\n                    ],\n                    \"url\": \"https://bigfuture.collegeboard.org/help-center/whos-eligible-scholarships-bigfuture\",\n                    \"dateCreated\": \"2026-11-16\",\n                    \"author\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n                        \"name\": \"College Board\",\n                        \"url\": \"https://www.collegeboard.org/\",\n                        \"sameAs\": [\n                            \"https://www.facebook.com/thecollegeboard\",\n                            \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-college-board\",\n                            \"https://twitter.com/collegeboard\",\n                            \"https://www.youtube.com/user/collegeboard\",\n                            \"https://www.instagram.com/collegeboard/\"\n                        ],\n                        \"logo\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n                            \"