n-content\" class=\"content-wrapper\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"main\">\n      \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      \n                <div id=\"block-apricot-theme-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      \n\n\n<div id=\"standard-page\" class=\"help_detail\">\n  \n                <div class=\"row\">\n\n        \n    <div\n            class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 offset-2xl-1 col-2xl-6\"\n      >\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"back cb-text-icon-left cb-link-black\"><span class=\"cb-icon cb-west\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Back</a>      <div >\n        \n            <div class=\"cb-band \n  \n  \n   \"\n  >\n    <div class=\"container\">\n    <div\n      class=\"row align-items-center \">\n          <div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n      <div class=\"cb-band-hero-content cb-padding-top-72 cb-padding-xs-top-48\">\n        <p\n          class=\"cb-black1-border cb-border-top display-inline-block cb-padding-top-8 cb-margin-bottom-24 cb-text-uppercase\">\n          FAQ</p>        <h1 class=\"cb-h2 cb-font-weight-regular\">Who\u2019s eligible for scholarships from BigFuture?</h1>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      \n  \n    </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"row hidden-md-up\n      \n      rl\">\n              </div>\n\n            <div  class=\"d8-wysiwyg cb-padding-bottom-72 cb-margin-top-24\">\n        \n            <p>Students in the classes of 2027, 2028, and 2029 are eligible for BigFuture Scholarships. They must have a College Board account and attend public or private high school or be enrolled in a home school in the United States, Puerto Rico, or any other U.S. territory. U.S. citizens and residents attending Department of War Education Activity (DoWEA) schools are also eligible. When students complete one or more qualifying steps on their BigFuture dashboard, they\u2019ll be automatically entered into monthly drawings for $500 or $40,000